## 7. Architecture Overview
AI Agent Guardian is a microservices-based architecture with clear separation between the System Under Test and the validation framework.

| Component | Technology | Role |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **SUT: AI Assistant** | Node.js + OpenAI / Ollama | Simulated LLM agent |
| **E2E Test Runner** | Cypress | UI/API functional test execution |
| **Performance Engine** | K6 | Load generation and latency profiling |
| **LLM Evaluator** | Python + OpenAI API | Semantic scoring, LLM-as-judge |
| **Data Store** | PostgreSQL | Test results, run history, scoring data |

